=== 8) why CodeQL / SBOM / Validate are NOT added as required contexts ===
- .github/workflows/validate.yml trigger: 'on: workflow_call' only -> emits no PR check-run.
  callers: deploy-do.yml (push main/develop | dispatch) and terraform-do.yml (dispatch) -> never on a PR.
  Requiring 'Validate' would leave required checks perpetually pending (the CI-P1-002 failure mode).
- AGENTS.md:63: 'CodeQL remains red on the pre-existing high-severity CSRF alert ... and not a required check.'
  Requiring a currently-red CodeQL check would block every merge to main.
- docs/CI.md:27: SBOM is 'Artifact-only (not a gate)' by design.
- docs/CI.md:20 lists CodeQL but docs/RELEASING.md:8 only asks for it to be green, not required.

